<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The clock read exactly 19:00.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> would still be at the police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and I had come back to Zahha.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... what's gonna happen to her now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It'll be all right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is a strong person."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is a little timid and delicate, the kind of person who looks like she could break at any moment.<PG>
But in the 3 years since we met, I have always been close by, watching <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's bad at sports, and sometimes the people around her even laughed at her in club activities and such, but she never, ever gave up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's a frail person, but she's not a weak person.<PG>
I truly respect that side of <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why I can feel that I want to be with <STYLE ID="1">this person</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If a <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> like that is in trouble, I want to be of help to her.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... saw her </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s face, didn't she... at the police station..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It seems so... It must have been really hard for her."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I said that, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> sank down onto the floor.
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
I called the police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As the phone rang, I prayed over and over, please let me just be overthinking this.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車室内エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\車内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "30"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\車内後部座席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Someone from the police station came to pick us up right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The whole time we rode in the patrol car, I held <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s hand.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> hung her head, blank and expressionless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was hanging her head the same way, but in contrast to <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, her face was rigid.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "350" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At the police station, the moment <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> met</STYLE> her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE>, they held each other, crying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From what I heard, her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> had been through quite a lot too.<PG>
Needless to say, her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE> had not gone to Hokkaido or anywhere of the kind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When he didn't show up for work on time, his company called <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at the time, <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was at <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s place, watching a DVD.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nobody was home, so the company called her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE>'s cell phone. That was how it went.<PG>
That was when it first came out that he had not gone to Hokkaido.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE> could not be reached, no matter what she tried.<PG>
Not wanting her <STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE> to worry, her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> sent <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> word: "I'll be late today."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> went to the police, but inside the police they were running around in circles over the flayed body case.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Someone thought, "It can't be."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE> = the flayed body<PG>
But until she was certain, her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> did not want to tell <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
To the police,<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Don't tell my </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> yet,"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
she said, but to the police, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> was a person of interest.<PG>
Without telling her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE>, the police went to <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s home, but nobody was in, so they pulled out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The patrol car we saw on our way back from Zahha was that one.<PG>
But when she was told that her <STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE>, who was supposed to be staying home, wasn't at the house next door either, she must have gotten worried after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her cell phone battery had died, so she called from the phone at the police station.<PG>
When <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> showed me the number that had called her, the last four digits were 0110.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is, with high probability, a number calling from a police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked like my bad feeling had hit the mark, at odds of better than 90 percent.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\霊安室表札.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> came face to face with her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It took a whole hour before <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> came out of the mortuary.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What did <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> think about during that time?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "550" "B" "100" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, accompanied by a police officer, came back to the waiting area where we were.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Hang in there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> ran straight to <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and held her up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "280" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... thank you. I'm okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s forced smile.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The truth is, I was scared to see </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face... But I'm glad I got to see his face one last time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... Then that's good..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Holding each other, the two of them sank down onto the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> kept her smile, but <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> burst out sobbing aloud.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't cry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I'm okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't bear to watch, and looked down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> looks weak, but she's strong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But when she tries to show us that strength, it gets harder for us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, why does </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hate cherry blossoms?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Who knows... Before I noticed, she'd always hated them. When we were little, we even went to hanami together, and yet... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Is there something to it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"This incident, when I think about </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s dream, I get the feeling it's connected to her April sickness. And then, the incident from more than 10 years ago." [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.]</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But that was an accident, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. It seems it was definitely an accident, but I can't ignore it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"True enough..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By then, I had firmly settled on one decision.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm thinking of looking into the incident from 10 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hold on a sec...!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="2">That's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I saw her <STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> holding each other, Senpai breaking down in tears, I made a vow in my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>―I want to help her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE> is never coming back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, but...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s killer... I want to find them."</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "9" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey now... I get how you feel, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> I love so much is suffering. I want to help her, even just a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> fell silent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must want to object, but the next words won't come.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
